// vendored fast_float `fast_table.h`; each pair was copied verbatim and no
// table value was recomputed. Upstream fastfloat/fast_float is pinned at
// commit 8ec59686a1430867ba609c2777ca15143dd81003 and is used here under the
// Boost Software License 1.0. See FAST_FLOAT_PROVENANCE.md, AUTHORS, and
// LICENSE-BOOST in this directory for the exact upstream/vendored hashes and
// the complete license text. The complete vendor copy remains under
// runtime/native/vendor/fast_float/ in the repository.
//
// The table is split into fixed-size switch blocks because a single switch
// with all 651 entries exceeds the compiler's pattern-coverage budget.
